#!/data/data/com.termux/files/usr/bin/bash
set -e

P="/data/data/com.termux/files/usr"

chmod 755 "$P/bin/rish" 2>/dev/null || true
chmod 400 "$P/lib/rish/rish_shizuku.dex" 2>/dev/null || true

if [ -e "$P/lib/rish/rish_shizuku.so" ]; then
    chmod 400 "$P/lib/rish/rish_shizuku.so" 2>/dev/null || true
fi

cat <<'MSG'
== rish-shizuku installed / instalado ==
EN - Installed:
  $PREFIX/bin/rish
  $PREFIX/lib/rish/rish_shizuku.dex
  $PREFIX/lib/rish/rish_shizuku.so (compatibility symlink, if present)

Usage:
  rish
  rish id
  rish -c 'command'

The wrapper clears LD_PRELOAD before starting app_process.
Shizuku must be active on the device.

If `command -v rish` does not point to $PREFIX/bin/rish, another copy
earlier in PATH is taking precedence.

ES - Instalado:
  $PREFIX/bin/rish
  $PREFIX/lib/rish/rish_shizuku.dex
  $PREFIX/lib/rish/rish_shizuku.so (symlink de compatibilidad, si existe)

Uso:
  rish
  rish id
  rish -c 'comando'

El wrapper limpia LD_PRELOAD antes de iniciar app_process.
Shizuku debe estar activo en el dispositivo.

Si `command -v rish` no apunta a $PREFIX/bin/rish, otra copia ubicada
antes en PATH está teniendo prioridad.
MSG
